	)
	(text "f_sw = 644 kHz (RT 150k). V_OUT = 0.8 V x (1 + 12k/2.2k) = 5.16 V. EN open = enabled, internal\nUVLO 4.3 V. Catch diode SS54: ~1 W at 3 A / 12 V in, give it copper."
